unified study on both image and motion generation. For the image domain, we select 50 prompts
from HPDv2 (Wu et al., 2023) and use FLUX.1 dev (Labs, 2024) as the base model. For each prompt,
we generate 12 images with 16 denoising steps, a guidance scale of 3.5, and a resolution of 720×720.
